# What this package builds and what its tooling leaves behind. Anything that
# every package produces -- build directories, CMake caches, editor and macOS
# droppings -- is at the root; these are the rules that name paths only this
# package has, and that used to sit at the root and match tree-wide.

# Packaging.
build-pkg/
*.driver
*.app
*.pkg

# Xcode.
*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
*.pbxuser
*.mode1v3
*.mode2v3
*.perspectivev3
*.xccheckout
*.moved-aside
DerivedData/
*.hmap
*.ipa
*.xcuserstate
project.xcworkspace/

# Swift build cache for the manager app.
ManagerApp/.build/

# Test output.
Tests/output/
Tests/*.log

# In-source CMake runs must never recommit their artifacts.
Examples/Makefile
Examples/CTestTestfile.cmake
Examples/ChannelMapperDemo
Examples/SimpleSDPParse
Tests/Makefile
Tests/CTestTestfile.cmake
Tests/Test*
!Tests/Test*.cpp
Tests/Benchmark*
!Tests/Benchmark*.cpp
